<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMP Inc upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMP Inc upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it raised its rating of AMP Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 earnings estimate to $2.22 a share from $2.00 a share.</p>
<p>--  AMP gained 3/4 to 42 in midday trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
